WEBVTT

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:25.620
Miwa?

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.680
It hurts, Mama!

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:29.800
Miwa!

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.790
It hurts...

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.760
My arms and legs hurt!

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:38.820
Are you Miwa?

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.080
Not Miwa...

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.820
Please... Not Miwa!

00:01:10.510 --> 00:01:11.710
Not Miwa...

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:13.840
Please!

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:15.840
Not Miwa!

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:26.560
How dare you?!

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.790
Where are you, Mama?

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:55.510
Mama...

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.090
Mama!

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:55.070
Sis! Miwa-chan!

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:56.390
Thank goodness...

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.890
Sis, who is that?

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:02.580
It's Miwa.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.450
She's asleep.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:09.960
Just accepting her own power
right now is taking all she has.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:12.260
Sis...

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:13.720
Maya-san!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:17.210
Yumiko-san! Thank goodness you're safe.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:19.720
Get on, girl!

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.720
Reflective camouflage and
Welle Shield 1 destroyed!

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.720
Countermeasures aren't working.

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.820
The Walker is still heading straight toward us!

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:23.960
Course: 15 degrees. Speed: 20.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.740
There's no need to take it head-on.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:27.970
Where are the Fafners?

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:29.700
All are standing by.

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:31.510
Again...

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:35.890
The burgs are reporting that they're
about to start up Sein and Nicht.

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:39.650
Hurry with the enemy analysis.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:49.280
The thoughts of people who were assimilated...

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.250
This many?

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:58.750
Warning.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.750
Vital damage to pilot has exceeded default value.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.100
Not yet...

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:06.630
My life is still here!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.600
Enemies are one Ousia-type
and four Sphinx B-types.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:30.030
They're heading straight for Hikojima.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.250
The same as the number of Fafners?

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:33.690
Fumihiko...

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.540
I'm sending out the Norns.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.040
After you just woke up?

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:41.740
I can still look into what the enemy is thinking.

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.040
I can't send out too many, though.

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.670
Norns deployed.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.440
Welle Shields 3 and 4 up.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.310
Battlefield established.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.820
Fafner unit, advance!

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:17.110
The Norns have engaged the Ousia-type.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:19.000
Distance to Hikojima: 5,000.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:20.870
Don't lose.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.500
Crossing clear.

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:27.000
All mechs, maintain positions.
Don't do anything careless.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:31.010
Huh? Kenji-senpai, you're running the system?

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.760
The enemy boss is nearby.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:36.440
We're all going home in one piece.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.280
We can't lose anyone!

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:40.060
That's too naïve...

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:44.690
Norns?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.680
They're taking the first engage for us.

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.320
Who's remotely controlling the drones?

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:02.370
Are you all right?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:05.100
Worry about yourselves.

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:07.880
The enemy has learned the island's power.

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:41.450
Gobain program, activate!

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.380
Mimika!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.210
It's going to fight us with swords?

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:06.060
Is this totally no-holds-barred?

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:18.660
There it is!

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:28.920
A whole flock to take our weapons away?

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:32.190
They're matching our pilots'
best qualities, one-on-one.

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.550
Pull back, Amaterasu! We're changing positions!

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:36.300
Best qualities...

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:40.100
So if I take out one,

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:42.140
I can take out all of them!

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.760
Ow!

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.990
I told you to pull back!

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:05.570
Those are SB rounds...

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.960
We changed all the wavelengths.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.710
Why aren't they hitting the enemy?

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:26.230
Damn it!

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:28.690
Put Tsukuyomi in pain-kill mode...

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.960
Remove contact restrictions!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.790
Mimika!

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.920
Damn it!

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:57.130
That thing...

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.140
It's reading my movements!

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:40.260
The Welle Shield's blocking the cockpit hatch...

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:42.080
The pilots can't break free.

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:44.510
CDC, requesting temporary shield removal!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:46.550
Commander Makabe!

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.410
Don't, Fumihiko.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.890
They are the soldiers who will protect the island.

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:55.770
If they still have power, they mustn't withdraw.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:56.980
Power...

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.440
They still have power?

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.090
I'm going to...

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:05.950
I'm going to protect the island!

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.800
I'm going to protect Tsubaki-chan's island!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:35.730
Zwölf is down!

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:38.170
Pilot's status is unknown!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.230
The Siegfried System is silent!

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:47.520
If I can just...

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:50.620
If I can just take you out!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.720
No way...

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:15.550
Welle Shield 3 is failing due to enemy attack!

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:17.100
Amaterasu has fallen!

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:18.980
What about Sein and Nicht?

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:21.400
They're still in startup stage 3.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.290
I don't care!

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:25.110
Prepare to open the Neidhöhle Gate!

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.120
No.

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:29.890
You must not let Kazuki and Soushi fight now.

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:32.330
The Fafner unit has been annihilated.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:36.250
We need the strength to cut
the blocks free and retreat!

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.950
The power you have obtained

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.250
is far greater than this.

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:55.270
Seri? Kaburagi?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.780
Guys, answer me!

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:22.500
No... Help me, Kenji-senpai...

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.990
You have to move faster!

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.800
Move faster!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.050
Faster!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.650
I have no weapon.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.680
Someone give me a weapon...

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.650
No! I don't want to die!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.130
Sis!

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:12.680
Damn... How long have I been stopped?

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:14.680
Three mechs can still move...

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:17.560
No... What is that?

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.820
Unknown field generating within Alvis!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.330
The enemy? Where is it?

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.220
It's...

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:36.950
In the keel block.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.600
The keel block?

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.060
Get up,

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:49.450
Seri.

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.970
Send out Mark Drei!

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.260
Sakura?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.880
That's insane!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:59.680
The entire system has been rebuilt for
development of unmanned mechs!

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:01.910
That doesn't matter! I still—

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.520
Zwölf has restarted!

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:05.480
What?

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:20.290
Why am I alive?

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:44.100
I'm just like Kazuki-senpai.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.100
Move!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:03.080
What's going on?

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.820
Where did this weapon come from?

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:34.440
Weapons are disappearing from all compartments!

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.320
No sign of them being ejected.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.450
What the hell is going on?

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.450
The cores of each mech...

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.540
They're multiplying!

00:17:44.990 --> 00:17:47.240
All Fafners, continue combat.

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:51.460
The burgs are reporting that an unknown
phenomenon is occurring in the cores.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:54.630
Is this the power?

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:59.490
Yes. The power you wished for,
and the power that woke me up.

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.970
A power that exists for your sakes.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:08.980
Be still, you damn ghosts!

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:12.730
Give me the power to control

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:16.490
this monster!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:38.510
We've finally unsealed the monster...

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.660
Nicht and Sein startup confirmed!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.660
Sein has awakened...

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.050
Damn you!

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:29.800
Zwölf, maintain position.

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:32.280
All other mechs, rotate positions.

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.650
Trade off on enemies, and protect your comrades.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:37.150
We're all going to survive.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:40.610
I'll protect the island.

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.800
I'll protect Tsubaki-chan's island...

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:49.250
Whatever it takes!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:10.600
Too slow!

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:31.500
That's checkmate.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:44.210
When Gobain shines in the mechanical forearm,

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:47.890
the inherited soul is an unbreakable sword!

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:53.020
Super Ultimate Attack: Gou Spark!

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:02.150
You read too much manga...

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:13.790
I'm not sure what's going on.

00:21:17.050 --> 00:21:22.010
But you're telling me to do what
Kazuki-senpai would, right?!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:38.520
We did it...

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:46.400
The boss is here.

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:14.010
We had but one wish...

00:22:14.890 --> 00:22:16.650
Long-lasting peace.

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:22.220
But what we acquired in order
to achieve that wish

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:26.170
was a power that would always be far from peace.

00:24:05.970 --> 00:24:09.190
<i>Fafner in the Azure: Exodus</i>, episode 8:

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:11.210
Dreaming of Peace.
